Filewinch {{VERSION}}, a two-pane file transfer app for SFTP, FTP/FTPS, WebDAV, S3, Azure Blob Storage, OpenStack Swift, Google Drive, Dropbox, OneDrive and Box. Free software under the GNU AGPL v3 or later.

{{CHANGELOG}}

